  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support CSW70 at the Global level</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at supporting the attendance of Christian Aid partner CREAW at the Commission on the Status of Women (CSW70) that will be held at the United Nations Headquarters in New York. This premier UN gathering focuses on gender equality, with CSW70 emphasizing judicial reform, gender-responsive legal frameworks, and women&apos;s participation in public spaces. During the CSW70 forum, CREAW Executive Director will also be a penalist at the Christian Aid side event &#x2018;Beyond Transitions: Feminist Lessons for Transforming Access to Justice&#x2019;.</narrative>
  </description>
